    "detailed_description": "This is a game centered around surviving in a harsh, cold environment, offering you the ultimate test of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, you will tackle the following primary tasks:<br />\r\nMining and logging: Gather resources to sustain survival and craft various items using these materials to create a habitable environment.<br />\r\nCrop cultivation: Cultivate crops in adverse conditions to meet food requirements.<br />\r\nAnimal husbandry: Acquire additional food and resources through animal breeding.<br />\r\nRecruiting NPCs: Employ assistants to help you complete various tasks and work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will need to carefully modify the environment, using a heating system to ensure a comfortable living environment for both yourself and the NPCs. However, you must also be mindful of the pollution generated by the heating system to maintain a delicate balance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, the game provides main storyline missions to guide you to explore the game world more deeply, but these missions are not mandatory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game offers both single-player mode and local network multiplayer mode, enabling you to cooperate with friends to face the challenges of this cold world together and create even more excitement and enjoyment.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a game centered around surviving in a harsh, cold environment, offering you the ultimate test of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, you will tackle the following primary tasks:<br />\r\nMining and logging: Gather resources to sustain survival and craft various items using these materials to create a habitable environment.<br />\r\nCrop cultivation: Cultivate crops in adverse conditions to meet food requirements.<br />\r\nAnimal husbandry: Acquire additional food and resources through animal breeding.<br />\r\nRecruiting NPCs: Employ assistants to help you complete various tasks and work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will need to carefully modify the environment, using a heating system to ensure a comfortable living environment for both yourself and the NPCs. However, you must also be mindful of the pollution generated by the heating system to maintain a delicate balance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, the game provides main storyline missions to guide you to explore the game world more deeply, but these missions are not mandatory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game offers both single-player mode and local network multiplayer mode, enabling you to cooperate with friends to face the challenges of this cold world together and create even more excitement and enjoyment.",
    "short_description": "A game that simulates survival in harsh cold environments, including game elements such as environmental exploration, technology development, and character development.",
